        "## Exercise 7: JAX Hardware Target Allocation\n",
        "\n",
        "To enable explicit execution of our machine learning arrays on specialized hardware, complete the helper function below. Use `jax.device_put()` to manually allocate your NumPy datasets into memory arrays assigned to a designated cluster target engine backend (`'cpu'`, `'gpu'`, or `'tpu'`)."
